%% Activity — CR / DCR assignment by the department admin
flowchart TD
  A([Dept admin opens section<br/>e.g. CSE 3-II-A, Fall 2026]) --> B{Rollover just happened?}
  B -- Yes --> C[See last semester's CR and DCRs]
  C --> D{Re-appoint with one action?}
  D -- Yes --> J
  D -- No --> E
  B -- No --> E[Search a student who has<br/>signed up and verified email]
  E --> F[/Choose role: CR or DCR/]
  F --> G{Role = CR and section<br/>already has a CR?}
  G -- Yes --> G1[Blocked: one CR per section] --> F
  G -- No --> H{Role = DCR and section<br/>already has 2 DCRs?}
  H -- Yes --> H1[Blocked: max two DCRs] --> F
  H -- No --> I[Confirm]
  I --> J[Save role for section + semester<br/>audit log: who, when]
  J --> K{First CR of section<br/>this semester?}
  K -- Yes --> L[Section opens for join requests<br/>section group chat created]
  K -- No --> M[Add as group owner]
  L --> M
  M --> N[Student sees role on profile<br/>and gets CR/DCR dashboard]
  N --> O([End])
  P([Admin removes role]) --> Q[Dashboard disappears at once<br/>open items go to admin; logged]
  Q --> R{Removed the CR?}
  R -- Yes --> S[Section closed to new join requests<br/>until a CR is named]
  R -- No --> O
  S --> O
